(property "ki_description" "DA16200 modules are the perfect complement to the DA16200 ultra-low power Wi-Fi SoC. They deliver the same long battery life and low power consumption but in a convenient form factor. The modules are complete with all required components and are regulatory certified by the FCC, IC, CE and other regulatory bodies.The fully integrated module consists of the DA16200 SoC, 4MB flash memory, RF components including crystal oscillator, RF lumped filter, and either a chip antenna or a connector for an external ante" (at 39.37 -294.92 0)
